| ------- | -------- |
| `search` | `global_search` |
| `dcim` | `device_list`, `device_detail`, `device_front_panel`, `dashboard_counters`, `rack_elevation`, `rack_list`, `topology`, `cable_list`, `trace_path` |
| `ipam` | `prefix_tree`, `prefix_list`, `prefix_addresses`, `vlan_list` |
| `firewall` | `path_analysis`, `rule_hygiene`, `firewall_rules`, `communication_matrix` |
| `ops` | `connector_status`, `drift_list`, `set_drift_state`, `alert_list` |
| `backup` | `backup_status` |
| `virt` | `cluster_overview`, `vm_list`, `host_detail`, `storage_overview` |
| `power` | `power_overview`, `power_impact` |
| `services` | `service_list`, `service_chain`, `impact_analysis` |
| `netsvc` | `network_services`, `floor_plan`, `floor_plan_list`, `ticket_list`, `remote_overview` |
| `cloud` / `identity` / `exposure` | `cloud_overview`, `identity_overview`, `exposure_overview` |
| `security` | `vulnerability_list`, `incident_list`, `security_overview` |
| `mail` | `mail_overview`, `gateway_status`, `flow_stats`, `mail_incidents`, `domain_check` |
